# The blog SOURCE lives in /blog in this repo and is published by a SEPARATE
# Cloudflare Pages project (root directory: blog) — it is not content for this
# site. Cloudflare follows redirects even when a static asset matches, so these
# rules keep the unbuilt source from ever being served on the apex domain.
#
# No /blog/<slug> URLs have ever existed here, so everything goes to the blog
# root rather than guessing at a post path.
/blog/*  https://blog.dermaglowbeauty.com/  301
/blog    https://blog.dermaglowbeauty.com/  301
